            <ArticleTitle>In vitro evaluation of coronary artery endothelial reactivity 11 years after transplantation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>904-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We studied in vitro the vascular reactivity of a transplanted heart which was explanted 11 years later for chronic rejection. Radiologic, histologic, and vascular aspects are presented and correlated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
